#api call for addition
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/add/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1":100,
    "num2":200
}


#api call for subtraction
###
POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/sub/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "num1":200,
    "num2":100
}


